==Introduction==

===Abstract===

This BIP defines a "varops budget", which generalizes the "sigops budget" introduced in [[bip-0342.mediawiki|BIP342]] to non-signature operations.

This BIP is a useful framework for other BIPs to draw upon: it provides cost primitives for fundamental script interpreter operations.  These primitives then compose to form the full cost for a single opcode.

